# Open ends tracker

This repo has OPEN_ENDS.md tracked by Flaux HQ.

- When you fix something listed there, tick it (`- [x]`) in the same change.
- When you notice a new bug, SEO gap, missing client input or unbuilt feature while working, add it under the right section as `- [ ] text #priority`. Don't fix unrelated things without asking.
- Never rename or remove the section headings.
- Never put secrets, passwords or API keys in OPEN_ENDS.md.

Example: correcting the Web3Forms sentence in `src/data/policies.ts` means ticking that line in OPEN_ENDS.md in the same commit:

```markdown
- [x] Privacy policy in src/data/policies.ts says bookings and enquiries are emailed through Web3Forms; table booking opens ReserveGo and event enquiries open WhatsApp. #high
```
